rchived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-07-25T01:29:28Z","updated_at":"2025-07-26T00:00:31Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 3.5.2 stable official.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot 3.5.2 stable official - Nvidia GTX 1070\n\n### Issue description\n\nImported an image with a very soft shadow. The image appears fine but the shadow looks glitchy, like a Jigsaw Puzzle. Only when the shadow is at 15% opacity starts to look fine, anything less than that and the bug occurs.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88cd234f-2728-42c5-a264-19606e5ce9f7)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/45fbd47e-a6a9-4942-865b-bb30eb72873a)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/23878645-8c29-4b0f-88a7-6891661bd333)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nExport a photoshop PNG with transparency and a soft shadow added to it (with blur, not a strong shadow) and put the shadow layer opacity at less than 15%.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[New Game Project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21421376/New.Game.Project.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/iss